:INFO
Art. 3
1 Articles 226f, 226g, 226h, 226i and 226k also apply to hire purchase agreements entered into prior to the commencement of this Act.2 Only Article 226k applies to advance payment agreements entered into prior to the commencement of this Act. These agreements must however be adapted to the provisions of the Article 227b within one year, failing which they lapse and the purchaser must be paid his entire credit balance with all the interest and benefits credited to him.
